  "The banner across the top of": "Sábhálann an bhratach thar barr",
  "The banner, category row, product row and SEO fields save together. Section tickboxes, ordering and custom section copy save on their own, as you change them.": "Sábhálann an bhratach, an tsraith chatagóir, an tsraith táirgí agus na réimsí Sinsearach le chéile. Sábhálann boscaí tic na rannóige, ordú agus cóip saincheaptha na rannóige ina n-aonar, de réir mar a athraíonn tú iad.",
  "The chat widget customers and visitors see on the storefront.": "An ghiuirléid chomhrá a fheiceann custaiméirí agus cuairteoirí ar aghaidh an tsiopa.",
  "The classic credential pair, including the password-reset flow.": "An péire clasaiceach creidiúnaithe, lena n-áirítear an sreabhadh athshocraithe pasfhocail.",
  "the farm owner": "úinéir na feirme",
  "The floating Help Assistant staff see on every admin page.": "Feiceann foireann an Chúntóra Cabhrach Snámh ar gach leathanach riaracháin.",
  "The header and footer link labels every page shows, translated per language (migration 0068). A locale left blank falls back to English on the storefront. This is the same control that fixes a header showing \"Shop\" / \"Seasonal\" in English while everything around it has switched language — those labels come from here, not from the page content translations above.": "Léiríonn an nasc ceanntásca agus buntásc gach leathanach, 00 teanga aistrithe (imirce). Titeann locale fágtha bán ar ais go Béarla ar aghaidh an tsiopa. Is é seo an rialú céanna a shocraíonn ceanntásc a thaispeánann \"Siopa\" / \"Séasúrach\" i mBéarla agus gach rud timpeall air athraigh teanga - is as seo a thagann na lipéid sin, ní ó na haistriúcháin ábhar leathanaigh thuas.",
  "The homepage has no sections": "Níl aon rannóg ar an leathanach baile",
  "The identity this console signs you in as, and the password it uses.": "An t-aitheantas a síníonn an consól seo isteach thú, agus an pasfhocal a úsáideann sé.",
  "The market": "An margadh",
  "The new password must differ from the current one.": "Ní mór an focal faire nua a bheith difriúil ón gceann reatha.",
  "The owner login starts from": "Tosaíonn an logáil isteach ón úinéir",
  "The page goes back to the site-wide colours. Nothing else about the page changes.": "Téann an leathanach ar ais go dtí na dathanna ar fud an tsuímh. Ní athraíonn aon rud eile faoin leathanach.",
  "The quiet revival of Indian millets": "Athbheochan ciúin na muiléad Indiach",
  "The role list could not be loaded from the API.": "Níorbh fhéidir an liosta ról a lódáil ón API.",
  "The rotating banner at the top of the homepage, plus the fallback copy shown when no slide has an image.": "An bhratach rothlach ag barr an leathanaigh baile, chomh maith leis an gcóip chúltaca a thaispeántar nuair nach bhfuil íomhá ag sleamhnán.",
  "The same kill-switch as Site Control's \"Accept orders and payments\", scoped to just this product. Uncheck it when this one item runs out or fails a quality check — the page stays live and browsable, but \"Add to basket\" is replaced with a message and a contact form until you switch it back on. This is independent of the site-wide switch: turning ordering off here has no effect on any other product.": "Scóipeáil an t-athrú marú céanna le “Glac le horduithe agus íocaíochtaí” de chuid Site Control, díreach chuig an táirge seo. Díthiceáil é nuair a bheidh an mhír amháin seo imithe i léig nó má theipeann ar sheiceáil cháilíochta - fanann an leathanach beo agus inbhraite, ach cuirtear teachtaireacht agus foirm teagmhála in ionad \"Cuir sa chiseán\" go dtí go gcuirfidh tú ar siúl arís é. Tá sé seo neamhspleách ar an lasc ar fud an tsuímh: ní bheidh aon éifeacht ag ordú a mhúchadh anseo ar aon táirge eile.",
  "The selected CMS page could not be loaded.": "Níorbh fhéidir an leathanach CMS roghnaithe a lódáil.",
  "The storefront's palette and the decoration on top of it.": "Pailéad aghaidh an tsiopa agus an maisiú ar a bharr.",
  "The two new passwords do not match.": "Ní ionann an dá phasfhocal nua.",
  "The upload API accepts JPG, PNG, WebP, and GIF files up to 5 MB. These stricter targets keep storefront pages fast and visually predictable.": "Glacann an API uaslódála le comhaid JPG, PNG, WebP agus GIF suas go 5 MB. Coinníonn na spriocanna níos déine seo leathanaigh aghaidh an tsiopa go tapa agus intuartha ó thaobh amhairc de.",
  "These are created by customers from a product page, once Subscribe & Save is switched on in Site Settings.": "Cruthaíonn custaiméirí iad seo ó leathanach táirge, a luaithe a bhíonn Liostáil & Sábháil curtha ar siúl i Socruithe an tSuímh.",
  "These colours also apply to pages beneath": "Baineann na dathanna seo leis na leathanaigh thíos freisin",
  "These roles define the permission sets available when inviting or editing users.": "Sainmhíníonn na róil seo na tacair cheadanna atá ar fáil agus cuireadh á thabhairt d’úsáideoirí nó nuair a bhíonn eagarthóireacht á déanamh orthu.",
  "Thinking…": "Ag smaoineamh…",
  "This application is": "Tá an feidhmchlár seo",
  "This order is in a final state.": "Tá an t-ordú seo i riocht deiridh.",
  "This page contains sensitive application diagnostics.": "Tá diagnóisic fheidhmchláir íogair ar an leathanach seo.",
  "This page requires the revenue.view permission.": "Tá cead revenue.view ag teastáil ón leathanach seo.",
  "This permanently removes the image from storage. Images still referenced by a product, page, article or recipe cannot be deleted.": "Baineann sé seo an íomhá go buan den stóras. Ní féidir íomhánna a bhfuil tagairt déanta dóibh fós ag táirge, leathanach, alt nó oideas a scriosadh.",
  "This records the payout against": "Taifeadann sé seo an íocaíocht amach in aghaidh",
  "This removes the bundle and its item list. Orders that already used it keep their own record.": "Baineann sé seo an beart agus liosta na n-earraí de. Coinníonn orduithe a d'úsáid cheana é a dtaifead féin.",
  "This removes the selected items for good — they can no longer be restored. Items still referenced by orders or other records (for example a product with order history) will be skipped with an error.": "Bainfear na míreanna roghnaithe mar is féidir iad a chur ar ais a thuilleadh. Déanfar scipeáil ar mhíreanna a bhfuil tagairt déanta dóibh fós le horduithe nó le taifid eile (mar shampla táirge a bhfuil stair na n-orduithe aige) trí earráid.",
  "This reset link is missing its token.": "Tá a chomhartha in easnamh ar an nasc athshocraithe seo.",
  "This section is edited in its own panel further down the page.": "Tá an chuid seo curtha in eagar ina phainéal féin níos faide síos an leathanach.",
  "Threads started from the storefront appear here.": "Tá snáitheanna tosaithe ó aghaidh an tsiopa le feiceáil anseo.",
  "Time": "Am",
  "Tinted band": "Banna tinted",
  "Title": "Teideal",
  "Title, description, keywords and indexing for storefront routes that aren't backed by a CMS page above. Leave a field blank to keep that route's built-in default.": "Teideal, cur síos, eochairfhocail agus innéacsú do bhealaí aghaidh siopa nach bhfuil leathanach CMS thuas mar thacaíocht leo. Fág réimse bán chun réamhshocrú ionsuite an bhealaigh sin a choinneáil.",
  "to add a link — plain text and internal/external URLs only, never raw HTML.": "chun nasc a chur leis — gnáth-théacs agus URLanna inmheánacha/seachtracha amháin, ní HTML amh riamh.",
