  "Turn off to freeze new registrations while existing customers keep signing in normally.": "Múch chun clárúcháin nua a reoite fad is a leanann custaiméirí atá ann cheana ag síniú isteach de ghnáth.",
  "Turn sign-in methods and ordering on or off without a deploy. The pill on the right is what customers actually get: a switch can only ever take a feature away, never add one the API is not configured for.": "Cuir modhanna síniú isteach agus cuir an t-ordú ar siúl nó as gan imscaradh. Is é an piolla ar dheis a fhaigheann custaiméirí: ní féidir le lasc ach gné a bhaint riamh, ná cuir ceann leis nach bhfuil an API cumraithe dó.",
